  "title": "6.Bir Peygamber Tanıyorum: Hz. İsa (as)",
  "htmlContent": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Hz. İsa (as) ve İncil: Bir Peygamber Tanıyorum</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #F9F9F9;
            color: #4A4A4A;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(132, 94, 194, 0.15);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            height: 100%;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        .main-header-bg {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #845EC2, #D65DB1);
        }
        .accent-text { color: #845EC2; }
        .feature-box {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            padding: 1rem;
            background-color: #F5F3FF;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border-left: 5px solid #845EC2;
        }
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #845EC2;
            margin-right: 1rem;
        }
        .timeline-item {
            position: relative;
            padding-bottom: 30px;
            border-left: 3px solid #FFC75F;
            margin-left: 20px;
        }
        .timeline-item::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: -13px;
            top: 0;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            border-radius: 50%;
